---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/nav/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/ui/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Support — Starmesh" description="Get help with Starmesh: connecting your CRM and calls, asking in Claude or ChatGPT, and account questions.">
  <Navbar />
  <main class="support-page">
    <h1>Support</h1>

    <section class="support-intro">
      <h2>Need help with Starmesh?</h2>
      <p>If you have a question or hit a problem connecting your CRM and calls, or asking about your pipeline and accounts in Claude or ChatGPT, email us.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="support-contact">
      <h3>Email support</h3>
      <p><a href="mailto:support@starmesh.ai">support@starmesh.ai</a></p>
      <p>We typically respond within one (1) business day.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="support-help">
      <h3>What we can help with</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Connecting sources:</strong> Salesforce or Attio, and Zoom, Teams, Google Meet, Gong, Granola, Gmail or Google Calendar.</li>
        <li><strong>Sign-in and permissions:</strong> OAuth errors, access scopes, team roles.</li>
        <li><strong>Missing or late data:</strong> a call or deal that has not shown up after a sync.</li>
        <li><strong>Wrong matches:</strong> a call linked to the wrong deal. You can also fix these under Review links in the app.</li>
        <li><strong>Claude and ChatGPT:</strong> adding Starmesh as a plugin or connector.</li>
        <li><strong>Plans:</strong> moving from the sample data to your own CRM and calls.</li>
        <li><strong>Data removal:</strong> disconnecting a source, or resetting or deleting your account.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="support-troubleshooting">
      <h3>Before you write</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Check the source is still connected in Settings, under Data sources.</li>
        <li>Check the account you connected can see the calls or deals you expect.</li>
        <li>Allow a few minutes after connecting for the first sync. The Connect page shows progress.</li>
        <li>See the <a href="/documentation">documentation</a> for setup steps.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="support-company">
      <h3>Company information</h3>
      <div class="company-info">
        <div>Starmesh Inc.</div>
        <div>California, USA</div>
        <div>Website: <a href="https://www.starmesh.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://www.starmesh.ai</a></div>
        <div>Email: <a href="mailto:support@starmesh.ai">support@starmesh.ai</a></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.support-page {
  max-width: 900px;
  margin: 4rem auto 2rem auto;
  padding: 2.5rem 2.5rem 2rem 2.5rem;
  background: none;
  border-radius: 0;
  color: #F4F2FF;
  font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 1.5rem;
}
.support-page h1 {
  font-size: 2.4rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  color: #F4F2FF;
  font-weight: 800;
  text-align: center;
}
.support-page h2 {
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  color: #F4F2FF;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  text-align: center;
}
.support-page h3 {
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  color: #F4F2FF;
  font-weight: 600;
  margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
  margin-top: 2.2rem;
}
.support-page p, .support-page ul {
  font-size: 1.12rem;
  color: #E4D6F5;
  margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
}
.support-page ul {
  padding-left: 1.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
}
.support-page li {
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
}
.support-note {
  color: #E4D6F5;
  font-size: 0.98rem;
  margin-top: 0.2rem;
  display: block;
}
.support-email {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 1.12rem;
  color: #2B2D3E;
  font-weight: 700;
  background: #F4F2FF;
  padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
  border-radius: 0.5rem;
  margin: 0.5rem 0 0.5rem 0;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;
}
.support-email:hover {
  background: #E4D6F5;
  color: #2B2D3E;
}
.company-info {
  color: #E4D6F5;
  font-size: 1.08rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
}
.support-page a {
  color: #F4F2FF;
  text-decoration: underline;
}
.support-page a:hover {
  color: #E4D6F5;
}
section {
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .support-page {
    padding: 1.2rem 0.5rem;
  }
}
</style> 